msgid ""
"Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your quantum "
"business skills and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr ""
"Ikuti ujian 20 pertanyaan di situs IBM Training untuk menguji kemampuan "
"bisnis kuantummu dan dapatkan lencana melalui Credly."

